{"author":316,"label":"Pritha Chakraborty","poems":[{"id":507,"source_language":"en","variants":{"en":{"label":"English","title":"Lethe","kind":"Original","stanzas":[["Complete oblivion,","or do wisps of memory lurk","in the shadows?"],["Down flows the tide—"],["Eternal amnesia","or reminiscences?","Ero and Thanatos","engage in a violent duel,","desolation","while the warm wine spills from the brimming goblet.","Conjecture is eternal."],["Daughter of Eris","You are indeed an offspring of","Strife."],["The boat sways","does it set sail?"]],"inline_breaks":[],"hidden_lines":[]},"hi":{"label":"हिन्दी","title":"लीथी","kind":"Translation","stanzas":[["पूर्ण विस्मृति,","या स्मृति के रेशे छिपे हैं","परछाइयों में?"],["नीचे बहता है ज्वार—"],["शाश्वत स्मृतिलोप","या स्मृतियाँ?","एरो और थानाटोस","एक हिंसक द्वंद्व में उलझते हैं,","उजाड़,","जबकि छलकते प्याले से गरम मदिरा बिखरती है।","अनुमान शाश्वत है।"],["एरिस की बेटी,","तुम सचमुच संतान हो","कलह की।"],["नाव डोलती है,","क्या वह पाल खोलती है?"]],"inline_breaks":[],"hidden_lines":[]},"or":{"label":"ଓଡ଼ିଆ","title":"ଲେଥେ","kind":"Translation","stanzas":[["ସମ୍ପୂର୍ଣ୍ଣ ବିସ୍ମୃତି,","ନା ସ୍ମୃତିର ସୂତାଖିଅ ଲୁଚିଛି","ଛାଇମାନଙ୍କ ଭିତରେ?"],["ତଳକୁ ବହେ ଜୁଆର—"],["ଚିରନ୍ତନ ସ୍ମୃତିଲୋପ","ନା ସ୍ମୃତିଚାରଣ?","ଏରୋ ଓ ଥାନାଟୋସ୍","ଭୟଙ୍କର ଦ୍ୱନ୍ଦ୍ୱଯୁଦ୍ଧରେ ମାତନ୍ତି,","ଉଜାଡ଼,","ଯେବେ ଉଛୁଳା ପାତ୍ରରୁ ଉଷୁମ ମଦିରା ଛଳକିପଡ଼େ।","ଅନୁମାନ ଚିରନ୍ତନ।"],["ଏରିସ୍‌ଙ୍କ କନ୍ୟା,","ତୁମେ ସତରେ ସନ୍ତାନ","କଳହର।"],["ଡଙ୍ଗା ଦୋହଲେ,","ସେ କ'ଣ ପାଲ ମେଲେ?"]],"inline_breaks":[],"hidden_lines":[]}},"end_mark":"leaf","author":"Pritha Chakraborty","route":"poem-507.html","portrait":"assets/writers/316-earth-voice-v1-64.webp","illustration":null,"availability":""},{"id":391,"source_language":"en","variants":{"en":{"label":"English","title":"Gray is not the Warmest Colour","kind":"Original","stanzas":[["Grey sky—","Monsoon dusk—","The dull sunlight is yet to fade.","And yet it is not luminous,","Soft beams linger on,","Like the memories of a lost lover,","Remembered and forgotten—","In the mind`s abyss."],["Vestiges 